Z||000007||2birds||02-01-2001||06:33 AM||||It's over near Tifton, about 2-3 hours from me.  It's supposed to be a big swap meet and car corral (which turns into a big show).  I haven't been yet, but a friend of mine goes every year and he says it's got everything there.  I'll get more info posted today when I find out exactly where it is.||||reg||1
